{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.HeckeAlgebra","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Dimension.Constructions"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.finrank_H3_eq_abs_eulerChar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.finrank_H3_eq_abs_eulerChar","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L132-L139","doc":"**`dim_R H₃(q) = |χ|`**, with the genus discharged rather than hypothesised.\n\n`constraints_satisfiable` supplies both cohomological constraints at `g = 4`, so\nthis is `abs_eulerChar_eq_finrank_H3` with nothing left to assume: the two\nquantities are equal, full stop. Still no mechanism — see the module docstring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.abs_eulerChar_four_eq_factorial_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.abs_eulerChar_four_eq_factorial_three","kind":"theorem","line":127,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L127-L130","doc":"The same identity with both sides shown: `|χ(Σ₄)| = 6 = 3! = dim H₃(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.abs_eulerChar_eq_finrank_H3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.abs_eulerChar_eq_finrank_H3","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L121-L125","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.finrank_H3Carrier_eq_factorial","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.finrank_H3Carrier_eq_factorial","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L112-L114","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.finrank_H3Carrier","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.finrank_H3Carrier","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L105-L110","doc":"`dim_R H₃(q) = 6 = 3!`. The carrier is `R⁶`, so this is the product formula;\nit is stated here because the corpus lost its copy when `QOU.Hecke.InstanceH3`\nwas retired (bean qou-ti7p) and nothing else records it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.eulerChar_forced","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.eulerChar_forced","kind":"theorem","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L97-L101","doc":"**`χ = −6`, from the cohomological constraints alone.** This is the constant\n`SubstrateRegime`, `collatz_obstruction_link` and `qou_ns_in_qou` quote. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.eulerChar_four","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.eulerChar_four","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L95-L95","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.eulerChar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.eulerChar","kind":"def","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L92-L93","doc":"Euler characteristic of a closed orientable genus-`g` surface, `χ = 2 − 2g`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.constraints_satisfiable","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.constraints_satisfiable","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L83-L88","doc":"Both constraints hold at `g = 4`, so `genus_forced`'s hypotheses are\nsatisfiable and the theorem is not vacuous. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.trefoil_embeds_at_forced_genus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.trefoil_embeds_at_forced_genus","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L79-L81","doc":"The trefoil `T_{2,3}` also embeds at the forced genus — the axioms are\nconsistent, not merely restrictive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.genus_forced","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.genus_forced","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L73-L77","doc":"**`g = 4` is forced.** `T_{2,9}` embedding gives `4 ≤ g`; `T_{2,11}` failing to\nembed gives `g < 5`. Clause (iv) of `prop:cohomological-embedding`, as a theorem. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.instDecidableEmbeds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.instDecidableEmbeds","kind":"instance","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L69-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.Embeds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.Embeds","kind":"def","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L66-L67","doc":"`T_{r,s}` embeds on `Σ_g` when its Seifert rank fits in `H¹(Σ_g)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.seifertRank_two_eleven","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.seifertRank_two_eleven","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L64-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.seifertRank_two_nine","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.seifertRank_two_nine","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L63-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.seifertRank_two_three","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.seifertRank_two_three","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L62-L62","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.seifertRank","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BringsSurface.EulerCharacteristicSix.seifertRank","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/EulerCharacteristicSix.lean#L58-L60","doc":"Seifert rank of the torus knot `T_{r,s}`: `rank H₁(Seifert(T_{r,s})) = (r−1)(s−1)/2`.\nClause (i) of `prop:cohomological-embedding`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}